diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..8daf87d0c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when a regular expression in a ``regexp_csv`` or ``regexp_paths_csv``
+option (e.g. ``bad-names-rgxs`` or ``ignore-paths``) contains a comma inside braces,
+such as ``(foo{1,3})``. Commas inside braces are no longer treated as separators.
+
+Closes #7229
